# The only real submodule here, and the only one that ever was.
#
# Nothing under `source/` belongs in this file: that content lives in independent repositories,
# `source/` is gitignored, and the index holds no gitlinks for it. Each module declares its own
# repositories in `modules/<module>/editor.yaml` under `sources:`, which is what the editor reads.
#
# FontPro is different: it is a third-party build tool pinned at a commit, which is exactly what a
# submodule is for. `install.sh` uses it to turn the MinionPro OTFs into the `MinionPro.sty` that
# `dgs.cls` requires. HTTPS rather than SSH because the repository is public, so building the
# fonts does not need a GitHub key.
[submodule "assets/fonts/FontPro"]
	path = assets/fonts/FontPro
	url = https://github.com/sebschub/FontPro.git
